@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### Healthcheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create idea (point)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ideas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Новая пешеходная зона",
  "description": "Сделать удобный маршрут между точками притяжения",
  "location": { "lng": 49.612, "lat": 54.234 }
}

### List approved ideas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/ideas

### Export approved ideas as GeoJSON
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/export?format=geojson

### Export approved ideas as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/export?format=csv

